  "lines": [
    "Too bad you can't go down the stairs forwards. Thanks to these life-changing knee straps, not for much longer.",
    "Built over three years with orthopaedic surgeons, to do what sleeves and braces never could. Perfect for bone on bone, arthritis, worn cartilage and meniscus pain. On every step down, seventeen times your bodyweight goes through one small spot below your kneecap. That's why you turn sideways. That's why you grip the railing. This strap redirects the load away from the worn spot. And the pain just lifts. So you come down facing forwards. One foot per step. Like a normal person again. Adjustable, breathable, with a silicone pad that locks the pressure right where you need it. No slipping. No sores. No rolling down. Recommended by orthopaedic surgeons for lasting relief. Buy one, get one free today at getstryde.co. Sixty-day money-back guarantee. Put one on. Go to your own stairs. Nothing to lose but the pain.",
    "Too bad you can't walk far without stopping anymore. Thanks to these life-changing knee straps, that's about to change.",
    "Built over three years with orthopaedic surgeons, to do what sleeves and braces never could. Perfect for bone on bone, arthritis, worn cartilage and meniscus pain. Every stride puts seventeen times your bodyweight through one small spot below your kneecap. By the end of the road, that spot has had enough. So you stop. This strap catches the weight before it hits the knee. The pain is pressure. Nothing more. Take the pressure off, and you keep going. To the shops and back. Round the park, the long way. Two miles, if you fancy it. Adjustable, breathable, light enough you forget it's there. No slipping. No sores. No rolling down. Over two hundred thousand people wear one now. Buy one, get one free today at getstryde.co. Sixty-day money-back guarantee. Go the long way round. Nothing to lose but the pain.",
    "Too bad someone else walks your dog now. Thanks to these life-changing knee straps, not for much longer.",
    "Built over three years with orthopaedic surgeons, to do what sleeves and braces never could. Perfect for bone on bone, arthritis, worn cartilage and meniscus pain. Here's why the walks got shorter. Every stride, seventeen times your bodyweight goes through one small spot below your kneecap. This strap redirects the load away from the worn spot. And the pain just lifts. So you take the lead back. Round the block first. Then the field. Then the long loop you both miss. Adjustable, breathable, with a silicone pad that locks the pressure right where you need it. No slipping. No sores. No rolling down. Sits flat under your trousers. Recommended by orthopaedic surgeons for lasting relief. Buy one, get one free today at getstryde.co. Sixty-day money-back guarantee. Get the lead. Nothing to lose but the pain.",
    "Too bad your golf clubs are still in the garage. Thanks to these life-changing knee straps, not for much longer.",
    "Built over three years with orthopaedic surgeons, to do what sleeves and braces never could. Perfect for bone on bone, arthritis, worn cartilage and meniscus pain. A round is hours on your feet. Every stride, seventeen times your bodyweight goes through one small spot below your kneecap. By the back nine, that spot is finished. This strap sits two centimetres below the kneecap and takes the weight off it. And the pain just lifts. So you walk the course instead of watching it. All eighteen. No buggy. Sits flat under your trousers. No slipping. No sores. No rolling down. Sports doctors recommend it. Over two hundred thousand people wear one now. Buy one, get one free today at getstryde.co. One for each knee. Sixty-day money-back guarantee. Book the tee time. Nothing to lose but the pain.",
    "Too bad you can't get down on the floor with the grandkids. Thanks to these life-changing knee straps, it doesn't have to stay that way.",
    "Built over three years with orthopaedic surgeons, to do what sleeves and braces never could. Perfect for bone on bone, arthritis, worn cartilage and meniscus pain. It's not getting down that stops you. It's getting back up. Seventeen times your bodyweight goes through one small spot below your kneecap. This strap redirects the load away from the worn spot. And the pain just lifts. So you get down among the toys. And you get back up on your own. No hand on the sofa. Nobody hauling you up. Adjustable, breathable, light enough you forget it's there. No slipping. No sores. No rolling down. Recommended by orthopaedic surgeons for lasting relief. Buy one, get one free today at getstryde.co. Sixty-day money-back guarantee. They won't be little for long. Nothing to lose but the pain."
